              "We run three event kitchens with eleven cooks, and we only noticed a short-staffed night once service had started. Laying out every shift as hours stacked per station fixed that. We rebalance on Thursday in a few minutes, the totals stop anyone quietly overworking, and the week view helps us quote honest dates to clients."
